  "user_request_original": "Design a non-periodic multilayer dielectric coating on fused silica substrate with air incidence at 0 degrees. The stack consists of 28 layers: alternating HfO2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) starting with HfO2 adjacent to air. All 28 layer thicknesses are independent optimization variables with no periodicity or gradient constraints. Optimize all thicknesses simultaneously to maximize transmittance in 1000-1700 nm band and reflectance in 300-450 nm band. Total layer count is exactly 28. Materials are HfO2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) only. Use global optimization algorithm to explore full parameter space.",
